## Home page becomes the Registry + Context menu status badge removed

Context: The Home page showed the "All Contexts" card grid and the navbar
Registry icon opened a Browse / Bridges popup. Both now live on Home in one
card with three tabs (Browse · Bridges · My tasks). The Registry popup and its
navbar icon are removed. Separately, the lifecycle status badge (Draft, In
Review, Published) was removed from the Context dropdown header in the L2
navbar. Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-18-home-registry-design.md

Changes:
1. src/front/templates/home.html: hero keeps logo + "OntoBricks" title + tagline
   (version badge removed). "All Contexts" grid removed. New card with tabs
   Browse (default), Bridges, My tasks (`#homeTabs`, `data-home-section`), with
   Registry partials and Export/Import modals included.
2. src/front/templates/partials/home/_home_my_tasks.html (new): My tasks pane.
3. src/front/templates/partials/registry/_registry_domains.html: Create button
   id renamed `btnRegistryModalNewDomain` -> `btnHomeNewDomain`.
