## Fix Home Illegal invocation (Bootstrap Tab on btn-group)

Context: Clicking a Home launch tile threw ``Uncaught TypeError: Illegal
invocation`` inside Bootstrap Tab (``SelectorEngine.find``). The modal header
switcher is a ``btn-group`` (``role="group"``), not a Tab parent (``.nav`` /
``role="tablist"``), so ``_parent`` was null.

Changes:
1. src/front/static/home/js/home.js: stop using ``bootstrap.Tab``; toggle panes
   and switcher state manually.
2. src/front/templates/home.html: remove ``data-bs-toggle="tab"`` /
   ``data-bs-target`` from the header switcher buttons.

Modified files:
- src/front/static/home/js/home.js
- src/front/templates/home.html

Tests:
- Playwright against local Home: no page errors; tiles + switcher open panes.
- Related unit tests: 174 passed.

